        "LocalizationKey": "Forest_Lore_FallenWatchtower_CardDescription",
        "DefaultText": "At the edge of the field a watchtower came down in one piece and was left where it fell: a tumble of dry-laid stone with the black ribs of its timbers sticking out. Whoever kept watch here saw the battle coming. The heap has not moved in all the years since, and what is in it can be had for the lifting."
